      "title": "Incorrect Behavior Order in com.google.protobuf:protobuf-java",
      "description": "Affected versions of com.google.protobuf:protobuf-java and com.google.protobuf:protobuf-kotlin are vulnerable to Incorrect Behavior Order. Parsing of unknown fields in the Java Protobuf runtime can be abused by a crafted binary payload (~800 KB) to trigger excessive short-lived object allocations, causing repeated GC pauses and prolonged parsing times, resulting in a Denial of Service.",
